.
.  Generate sample output for confidence limits
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na anscomb1.ps
device 2 postscript
tic mark label size 3.5
label size 4
title size 4
.
skip 25
read anscombe.dat x1 y1
fit y1 x1
character hw 3 2.25
character circle BLANK
character fill on
line blank solid
tic offset units data
xtic offset 0.5 0.5
plot y1 x1 and
plot pred x1
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv ANSCOMB1.PS anscomb1.ps
.
quit
